  "reason": "All benchmark-AOC-001 images display readable, well-lit, non-duplicative, and context-specific photography and clear editorial structure for route, subject and visual transitions. Quality bar is met across navigation, visual uniformity, copy, and subject-specific media in each route. | Scenes do not fully match the editorial/geographic specificity and depth in AOC-001 benchmarks. Visual diversity is less than benchmark standard, and key scenes remain generic in narrative focus. | Benchmark standard demonstrates documentary or sourced contextual images with strong editorial relevance at key visual placements. Use of AI-generated illustrations for principal scenes fails parity on visual specificity and continuity. Otherwise, structure, sources, story/fact separation, geography, and editorial depth are maintained."
